 1038 #edb/ref 17592186111377 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110618 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186486360 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110618 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186486448 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110618 #edb/ref 1039 "Combining the Product and Quotient Rules of Exponents" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110618 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186110508 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110618 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "376ceac4-b0bb-5178-81e9-38e724cceaee" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186111523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186111524 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186111525 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186111531 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1045 "Combining the Rules of Exponents" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186111531 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049059 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110829 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "812cb5a9-d9bb-5df5-bcad-60b2e4bca49c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111523 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111524 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111523 #edb/ref 1061 17217 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111523 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e1f34a4c-5543-5841-9a26-631425dd8218" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111523 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110616 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111524 #edb/ref 1061 17218 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111524 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "869d7516-5f01-5ae5-8aa5-fa957c225b74" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111524 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110617 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111525 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111525 #edb/ref 1061 17336 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111525 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "99b9d947-8b7b-5e8a-a9e4-9d2b3a2979a2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111525 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110618 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111531 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111525 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111531 #edb/ref 1061 17999 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111531 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8150e1a1-0f41-5dc7-a1db-5e474331d638" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111531 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186111884 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111884 #edb/ref 1064 "Let's recap some of the rules for exponents.\n\n- **Product rule**: to multiply powers of the same base, add the exponents.\n\n- **Quotient rule**: to divide powers of the same base, subtract the exponents.\n\n- **Power rule**: to raise a power to another power, multiply the exponents.\n\n- **Power of product rule**: to raise the product of two numbers to a power, raise each number to that power, and then multiply.\n\n- **Power of quotient rule**: to raise a fraction to a power, raise both the numerator and the denominator to that power.\n\nWe can use a combination of these rules to simplify expressions containing exponents. Let's see an example of this." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111884 #edb/ref 1065 3275 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111884 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "7c442391-b257-5c16-9fe0-292a45e3c172" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111884 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186227997 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186488856 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186227997 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186227997 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186227997 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186488856 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186227997 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "40d930ab-9b4f-5758-a9bc-0cebb8f98bdd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186229193 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050030 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186229193 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050716 #edb/ref 17